          "text": "You will learn"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005078887-How-to-combine-2-or-more-lists-in-Klaviyo#h_01H8YXX41NM3FVBR5J0JW6YZ17",
